stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> queued: tasks.enqueue (POST /tasks, aeos submit)
  queued --> running: tasks.claim (lease, attempts+1)
  running --> running: heartbeat renews lease every lease_s/3
  running --> queued: lease expired (worker died) and attempts < max
  running --> queued: release_with_error (unexpected exception)
  running --> escalated: claim guard: attempts >= max_attempts
  running --> paused: graph hit interrupt (awaiting approval)
  paused --> queued: apply_decision / expire_due (enqueue_resume, same txn)
  running --> completed: PR created
  running --> failed: finish node status failed
  running --> escalated: retries/replans exhausted, denied, expired
  queued --> cancelled: POST /tasks/id/cancel
  running --> cancelled: cancel (worker fenced at next heartbeat)
  paused --> cancelled: cancel
  completed --> [*]
  failed --> [*]
  escalated --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]
